<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Ablation Study on Reward Modeling for the <span id="S4.T4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Parallel-R1-Unseen</span> Model.</figcaption>
