<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Parallel Thinking Format Check</figcaption>
<p id="alg1.4" class="ltx_p ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom"><span id="alg1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> tokens – list of tokens from the parallel‑thinking trace; 
<br class="ltx_break">    tag_pairs – set of valid (opening, closing) tag pairs, e.g. {(<code id="alg1.4.2" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;Path&gt;…&lt;/Path&gt;</code>), …} 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="alg1.4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span> format_valid – boolean indicating whether the trace is well‑formed</p>
<br class="ltx_break ltx_break">
<div id="alg1.5" class="ltx_listing ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
