<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Case Studies</h2>

<figure id="A2.F5" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.F5.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="288.92" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 600 288.92" width="600"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,288.92) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><clipPath id="pgfcp16"><path d="M -22670.54 -22670.54 L 22670.54 -22670.54 L 22670.54 22670.54 L -22670.54 22670.54 Z M 0 0 L 0 288.92 L 600 288.92 L 600 0 Z"></path></clipPath><g fill-rule="evenodd"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 288.92 L 600 288.92 L 600 0 Z M 1.97 1.97 L 1.97 286.96 L 598.03 286.96 L 598.03 1.97 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 1.97 L 1.97 286.96 L 598.03 286.96 L 598.03 1.97 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.47)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:40.23em;--ltx-fo-height:18.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="261.37" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 258.68)" width="556.67"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.F5.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:40.23em;">
<span id="A2.F5.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F5.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Case Study:<span id="A2.F5.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Find the sum of all integer bases <math id="A2.F5.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b&gt;9" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&gt;</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b&gt;9</annotation></semantics></math> for which <math id="A2.F5.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="17_{b}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">17</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">17_{b}</annotation></semantics></math> is a divisor of <math id="A2.F5.pic1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="97_{b}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">97</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">97_{b}</annotation></semantics></math>. 
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:3.0pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.F5.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F5.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">First, the number <math id="A2.F5.pic1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="17_{b}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">17</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">17_{b}</annotation></semantics></math> in base <math id="A2.F5.pic1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b</annotation></semantics></math> is equal to <math id="A2.F5.pic1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\times b+7=b+7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\times b+7=b+7</annotation></semantics></math> in base 10.
Similarly, <math id="A2.F5.pic1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="97_{b}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">97</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">97_{b}</annotation></semantics></math> is equal to <math id="A2.F5.pic1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="9\times b+7=9b+7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">9</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">9</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">9\times b+7=9b+7</annotation></semantics></math> in base 10.
We need to find all integer bases <math id="A2.F5.pic1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b&gt;9" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&gt;</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b&gt;9</annotation></semantics></math> such that <math id="A2.F5.pic1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b+7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b+7</annotation></semantics></math> divides <math id="A2.F5.pic1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="9b+7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">9</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">9b+7</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
<span id="A2.F5.pic1.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F5.pic1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">At this point, consider two distinct strategies for finding <math id="A2.F5.pic1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b</annotation></semantics></math>:
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A2.F5.pic1.1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><span class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></span>
<span id="lstnumberx19" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx19.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;</span><span id="lstnumberx19.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Parallel</span><span id="lstnumberx19.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&gt;</span>
</span>
<span id="lstnumberx20" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;</span><span id="lstnumberx20.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Path</span><span id="lstnumberx20.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&gt;</span>
</span>
<span id="lstnumberx21" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx21.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Factor</span><span id="lstnumberx21.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">theorem</span><span id="lstnumberx21.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">approach</span><span id="lstnumberx21.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">:</span><span id="lstnumberx21.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Consider</span><span id="lstnumberx21.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">9</span><span id="lstnumberx21.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">b</span><span id="lstnumberx21.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">+</span><span id="lstnumberx21.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.15" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">7</span><span id="lstnumberx21.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">as</span><span id="lstnumberx21.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">a</span><span id="lstnumberx21.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">polynomial</span><span id="lstnumberx21.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">in</span><span id="lstnumberx21.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">b</span><span id="lstnumberx21.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.27" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">and</span><span id="lstnumberx21.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.29" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">use</span><span id="lstnumberx21.30" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.31" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">the</span><span id="lstnumberx21.32" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.33" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">factor</span><span id="lstnumberx21.34" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.35" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">theorem</span><span id="lstnumberx21.36" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span>
</span>
<span id="lstnumberx22" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx22.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Since</span><span id="lstnumberx22.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">b</span><span id="lstnumberx22.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">+</span><span id="lstnumberx22.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">7</span><span id="lstnumberx22.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">divides</span><span id="lstnumberx22.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">9</span><span id="lstnumberx22.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">b</span><span id="lstnumberx22.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.14" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">+</span><span id="lstnumberx22.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.16" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">7,</span><span id="lstnumberx22.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">by</span><span id="lstnumberx22.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">the</span><span id="lstnumberx22.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">factor</span><span id="lstnumberx22.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">theorem</span><span id="lstnumberx22.25" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">,</span><span id="lstnumberx22.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.27" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">9(-7)</span><span id="lstnumberx22.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.29" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">+</span><span id="lstnumberx22.30" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.31" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">7</span><span id="lstnumberx22.32" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.33" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">=</span><span id="lstnumberx22.34" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.35" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">-63</span><span id="lstnumberx22.36" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.37" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">+</span><span id="lstnumberx22.38" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.39" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">7</span><span id="lstnumberx22.40" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.41" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">=</span><span id="lstnumberx22.42" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.43" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">-56</span><span id="lstnumberx22.44" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.45" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">must</span><span id="lstnumberx22.46" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.47" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">be</span><span id="lstnumberx22.48" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.49" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">divisible</span><span id="lstnumberx22.50" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.51" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">by</span><span id="lstnumberx22.52" class="ltx_text ltx_